00:15:59.970 --> 00:16:04.230
Everything you want to know--

00:16:04.230 --> 00:16:04.980
GREG BRAIL: Right.

00:16:04.980 --> 00:16:07.090
So on the right I have
a nicely formatted set

00:16:07.090 --> 00:16:08.557
of docs for my API.

00:16:08.557 --> 00:16:09.640
PRITHPAL BHOGILL: Exactly.

00:16:09.640 --> 00:16:11.290
And then more
