00:21:51.540 --> 00:21:53.960
So in this case, what I
would like to show you is,

00:21:53.960 --> 00:21:59.210
great, I have an API, and
this is where the API proxy

00:21:59.210 --> 00:22:00.110
magic starts.

00:22:00.110 --> 00:22:03.440
So in this case, I've opened
up an API proxy editor.

00:22:03.440 --> 00:22:07.250
This is where I, as the API
developer, or the API team,

00:22:07.250 --> 00:22:10.460
has the ability to put in a
lot of different controls.

00:22:10.460 --> 00:22:13.850
And you put in those controls
