00:22:22.740 --> 00:22:26.050
policies that we have to do a
variety of different things.

00:22:26.050 --> 00:22:30.270
We have some traffic
management policies, security--

00:22:30.270 --> 00:22:33.280
some of this we're going to
be taking a look at later on--

00:22:33.280 --> 00:22:35.170
mediation.

00:22:35.170 --> 00:22:37.644
And then more importantly,
you can extend the platform

00:22:37.644 --> 00:22:39.310
by using some of the
extension policies.

00:22:39.310 --> 00:22:41.890
So you could literally use
things like Java, JavaScript,

00:22:41.890 --> 00:22:45.040
or Python to pretty much
